1
00:00:42,450 --> 00:00:43,250
Boss.

2
00:00:46,360 --> 00:00:49,000
[Eclipse in the Lost City]
[Episode 17]

3
00:01:18,330 --> 00:01:19,770
Lu Ye.

4
00:01:20,410 --> 00:01:22,210
You really are something

5
00:01:22,770 --> 00:01:24,610
You can even survive this.

6
00:01:25,090 --> 00:01:26,890
Chief Xu, you flatter me.

7
00:01:26,970 --> 00:01:28,370
I haven't killed you yet.

8
00:01:28,480 --> 00:01:29,400
How could I die?

9
00:01:32,950 --> 00:01:34,670
You are still too young.

10
00:01:34,820 --> 00:01:35,940
If you kill me,

11
00:01:35,970 --> 00:01:39,490
you will never know how your father died.

12
00:01:39,930 --> 00:01:40,970
It doesn't matter.

13
00:01:40,970 --> 00:01:42,370
After fighting for so long,

14
00:01:42,370 --> 00:01:43,430
I'm already tired.

15
00:01:43,729 --> 00:01:46,330
Save your words for the road
to the underworld.

16
00:01:47,810 --> 00:01:48,930
Farewell.

17
00:01:52,130 --> 00:01:53,050
Tianbai.

18
00:01:53,810 --> 00:01:54,650
Tianbai!

19
00:01:55,690 --> 00:01:56,460
Hurry!

20
00:01:56,500 --> 00:01:58,100
Get him to emergency, quick!

21
00:02:00,970 --> 00:02:01,770
Lu Ye.

22
00:02:02,530 --> 00:02:04,050
You can't escape.

23
00:02:06,690 --> 00:02:07,810
Is that so?

24
00:02:09,090 --> 00:02:12,650
It seems Chief Xu is determined
to kill me today.

25
00:02:12,970 --> 00:02:13,850
That's right.

26
00:02:14,970 --> 00:02:16,450
Then I have no choice anymore.

27
00:02:16,450 --> 00:02:19,170
I can only let your daughter, Miss Xu Yin,

28
00:02:19,770 --> 00:02:20,690
die with me.

29
00:02:20,710 --> 00:02:21,350
What...

30
00:02:21,690 --> 00:02:22,690
What did you do?

31
00:02:22,850 --> 00:02:23,650
Nothing much.

32
00:02:23,840 --> 00:02:25,560
Chief Xu has been so hospitable.

33
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:27,620
I naturally have to return the favor.

34
00:02:27,750 --> 00:02:30,120
It's just some hospitality.

35
00:02:39,460 --> 00:02:42,579
[Xu Qingdao's daughter, Xu Yin]

36
00:02:43,730 --> 00:02:44,650
Miss Xu Yin.

37
00:02:44,890 --> 00:02:46,970
The Chief specially sent us to
pick you up.

38
00:02:46,970 --> 00:02:47,770
Please.

39
00:02:51,570 --> 00:02:52,370
Let me go.

40
00:02:54,930 --> 00:02:57,329
I remember Miss Xu's train arrives
at nine.

41
00:02:57,690 --> 00:03:00,570
If I'm not back at the Qingtian Gang
by ten,

42
00:03:00,850 --> 00:03:02,980
I'm afraid you'll only see her corpse.

43
00:03:04,450 --> 00:03:06,810
Let me see how many minutes are left.

44
00:03:08,260 --> 00:03:09,060
Chief Xu,

45
00:03:09,370 --> 00:03:13,650
do you want to bet
if I'm telling the truth?

46
00:03:21,250 --> 00:03:23,050
Take him back to the Qingtian Gang

47
00:03:23,050 --> 00:03:24,210
to exchange for my daughter.

48
00:03:24,210 --> 00:03:24,850
Chief...

49
00:03:25,370 --> 00:03:26,890
Do I need to repeat myself?

50
00:03:28,090 --> 00:03:29,650
Listen up, everyone.

51
00:03:30,490 --> 00:03:33,290
Send him back unharmed

52
00:03:33,970 --> 00:03:36,010
and bring the Miss Xu back safely.

53
00:03:36,250 --> 00:03:37,050
Yes.

54
00:03:37,510 --> 00:03:39,440
Such a deep father-daughter bond.

55
00:03:49,770 --> 00:03:50,570
Young Master.

56
00:03:51,290 --> 00:03:52,090
Uncle Zhong.

57
00:03:52,530 --> 00:03:53,329
Be careful.

58
00:03:53,900 --> 00:03:54,960
Don't hurt Miss Xu.

59
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:55,800
You.

60
00:03:55,890 --> 00:03:56,550
Don't move.

61
00:03:57,770 --> 00:03:59,230
Listen up, you over there.

62
00:03:59,610 --> 00:04:00,740
I'll count to three,

63
00:04:00,970 --> 00:04:02,570
and we let go at the same time.

64
00:04:03,780 --> 00:04:04,270
Three.

65
00:04:05,720 --> 00:04:06,290
Two.

66
00:04:07,450 --> 00:04:08,320
One.

67
00:04:12,890 --> 00:04:13,690
Miss Xu.

68
00:04:15,740 --> 00:04:18,360
You had such a big scare
right after returning to the country.

69
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:19,290
I'm really sorry

70
00:04:29,050 --> 00:04:30,070
This will hurt a little.

71
00:04:30,070 --> 00:04:30,790
All done.

72
00:04:34,650 --> 00:04:35,530
Young Master.

73
00:04:35,970 --> 00:04:37,890
How many times have I told you

74
00:04:38,220 --> 00:04:39,409
to take care of yourself?

75
00:04:39,409 --> 00:04:40,490
Take care of yourself.

76
00:04:40,490 --> 00:04:41,230
Look.

77
00:04:41,590 --> 00:04:43,290
How did you end up like this again?

78
00:04:43,290 --> 00:04:44,610
And Shen Tianbai, too.

79
00:04:44,770 --> 00:04:46,290
Wasn't it supposed to be just an act?

80
00:04:46,290 --> 00:04:47,490
Why did he hit so hard?

81
00:04:47,810 --> 00:04:48,330
This kid...

82
00:04:48,330 --> 00:04:49,060
Uncle Zhong.

83
00:04:50,250 --> 00:04:51,210
Don't worry.

84
00:04:51,530 --> 00:04:52,930
He's hurt worse than I am.

85
00:04:53,130 --> 00:04:54,210
I shot him.

86
00:04:55,050 --> 00:04:57,050
But taking this bullet was worth it.

87
00:04:57,390 --> 00:04:59,390
Although there was a slight hiccup,

88
00:04:59,490 --> 00:05:00,850
it's still within the plan.

89
00:05:00,850 --> 00:05:02,740
He took a fatal shot for Xu Qingdao.

90
00:05:02,740 --> 00:05:06,340
Now he is Xu Qingdao's
most trusted subordinate.

91
00:05:11,610 --> 00:05:12,890
Do you remember?

92
00:05:13,290 --> 00:05:14,930
We used to fight in school.

93
00:05:15,170 --> 00:05:17,410
We are friends.

94
00:05:22,490 --> 00:05:23,290
Chief.

95
00:05:24,450 --> 00:05:25,250
Tianbai.

96
00:05:30,090 --> 00:05:31,370
Tianbai.

97
00:05:32,010 --> 00:05:33,210
I owe you this time.

98
00:05:33,810 --> 00:05:34,890
You saved my life.

99
00:05:35,490 --> 00:05:36,450
Chief,

100
00:05:36,700 --> 00:05:37,970
it's my duty.

101
00:05:38,409 --> 00:05:39,670
As long as you're fine.

102
00:05:39,850 --> 00:05:40,650
Good.

103
00:05:41,050 --> 00:05:42,650
I knew I was right about you.

104
00:05:43,130 --> 00:05:44,770
Things in Ningcheng

105
00:05:44,930 --> 00:05:46,370
are about to change.

106
00:05:47,450 --> 00:05:51,090
But you and I are in the same boat
after all.

107
00:05:51,490 --> 00:05:52,290
Yes.

108
00:05:52,930 --> 00:05:54,210
Get some rest first.

109
00:05:54,370 --> 00:05:55,490
As for the rest,

110
00:05:55,570 --> 00:05:56,690
once you recover,

111
00:05:57,210 --> 00:05:59,570
we'll discuss it further.

112
00:06:00,450 --> 00:06:01,500
Yes, Chief.

113
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:12,920
Yin.

114
00:06:13,190 --> 00:06:14,070
Father!

115
00:06:14,570 --> 00:06:15,490
Are you okay?

116
00:06:15,490 --> 00:06:16,450
Let me see.

117
00:06:16,580 --> 00:06:17,380
Father.

118
00:06:17,450 --> 00:06:19,740
I thought I would never see you again.

119
00:06:19,770 --> 00:06:20,840
Glad you're safe.

120
00:06:20,870 --> 00:06:22,050
Glad you're safe.

121
00:06:22,690 --> 00:06:24,200
Did the Qingtian Gang do anything to you?

122
00:06:24,200 --> 00:06:25,320
No.

123
00:06:25,490 --> 00:06:27,210
With you here, they wouldn't dare.

124
00:06:27,210 --> 00:06:27,490
Yes.

125
00:06:27,490 --> 00:06:29,170
Father, I'm so glad you came to save me.

126
00:06:29,170 --> 00:06:30,250
Silly girl.

127
00:06:30,250 --> 00:06:32,050
You are my only daughter.

128
00:06:32,090 --> 00:06:33,770
Your life is more important than anything.

129
00:06:33,770 --> 00:06:34,370
Come.

130
00:06:34,370 --> 00:06:35,250
Sit down.

131
00:06:42,250 --> 00:06:43,330
Yin.

132
00:06:43,530 --> 00:06:46,270
You've been studying abroad
all these years.

133
00:06:46,290 --> 00:06:48,450
I've always been worried about you.

134
00:06:49,770 --> 00:06:51,810
I'm getting old now.

135
00:06:52,659 --> 00:06:54,659
I just hope you can stay in Ningcheng

136
00:06:54,750 --> 00:06:55,950
and stay by my side.

137
00:06:56,450 --> 00:06:57,170
Okay?

138
00:06:58,260 --> 00:06:58,820
Okay.

139
00:06:58,850 --> 00:07:00,230
I'll stay by your side

140
00:07:00,250 --> 00:07:01,290
and won't go anywhere.

141
00:07:01,290 --> 00:07:02,530
Silly girl.

142
00:07:02,690 --> 00:07:04,620
How can you stay by my side forever?

143
00:07:04,710 --> 00:07:05,690
When you reach the right age,

144
00:07:05,690 --> 00:07:07,100
you'll have to get married.

145
00:07:07,100 --> 00:07:07,980
Father.

146
00:07:08,930 --> 00:07:12,330
I've already found the best candidate
for you.

147
00:07:13,060 --> 00:07:14,460
His name is Shen Tianbai.

148
00:07:14,760 --> 00:07:16,920
He just saved my life.

149
00:07:17,170 --> 00:07:18,430
He has a bright future.

150
00:07:18,510 --> 00:07:20,110
You'll definitely like him.

151
00:07:21,130 --> 00:07:21,690
Okay.

152
00:07:21,720 --> 00:07:22,780
I'll listen to you.

153
00:07:24,460 --> 00:07:26,700
Go and bring him some medicine.

154
00:07:27,970 --> 00:07:29,850
You really are my good daughter.

155
00:07:30,100 --> 00:07:30,940
I'll go then.

156
00:07:52,510 --> 00:07:53,640
Since you're awake,

157
00:07:53,650 --> 00:07:55,310
stop pretending to be asleep.

158
00:08:01,930 --> 00:08:03,410
Hello, Xu Yin.

159
00:08:07,210 --> 00:08:08,010
Miss Xu.

160
00:08:10,100 --> 00:08:11,300
You're so formal.

161
00:08:16,420 --> 00:08:18,620
Do you know why my father called me here?

162
00:08:19,970 --> 00:08:21,210
You saved his life.

163
00:08:21,450 --> 00:08:23,570
Now you are his most trusted confidant.

164
00:08:23,570 --> 00:08:25,090
He wants me to marry you

165
00:08:25,170 --> 00:08:27,170
to tie you firmly to the Shisha Gang.

166
00:08:27,690 --> 00:08:29,220
You must be joking, Miss Xu.

167
00:08:29,250 --> 00:08:30,570
To him,

168
00:08:30,650 --> 00:08:31,930
I am just an object.

169
00:08:32,010 --> 00:08:34,289
Who to give me to, when to give me,

170
00:08:34,330 --> 00:08:35,549
and what benefits it can bring

171
00:08:35,549 --> 00:08:37,190
are all calculated clearly.

172
00:08:37,409 --> 00:08:41,010
But rather than being someone's wife,

173
00:08:44,130 --> 00:08:46,260
I'd rather be the chief of Shisha Gang.

174
00:08:46,370 --> 00:08:47,450
Miss Xu.

175
00:08:48,340 --> 00:08:49,470
What does this mean?

176
00:08:51,250 --> 00:08:51,930
Time is tight,

177
00:08:51,930 --> 00:08:53,790
so I'll get straight to the point.

178
00:08:55,570 --> 00:08:57,630
I'm here to deliver a letter for Lu Ye.

179
00:08:59,040 --> 00:08:59,840
Young Master,

180
00:09:00,030 --> 00:09:02,870
although Miss Xu Yin
is your college classmate,

181
00:09:03,190 --> 00:09:05,380
she is Xu Qingdao's daughter after all.

182
00:09:05,380 --> 00:09:06,340
What if...

183
00:09:07,050 --> 00:09:07,850
Don't worry.

184
00:09:08,570 --> 00:09:11,570
She hates Xu Qingdao just as much as I do.

185
00:09:14,730 --> 00:09:15,730
Do you remember

186
00:09:15,800 --> 00:09:18,660
how Xu Qingdao became the leader
of the Shisha Gang?

187
00:09:20,090 --> 00:09:24,570
I remember the former leader
didn't favor him,

188
00:09:24,730 --> 00:09:26,010
but his sworn brother.

189
00:09:26,130 --> 00:09:28,330
Later, that man died in an accident,

190
00:09:28,770 --> 00:09:31,410
and Xu Qingdao naturally took over.

191
00:09:32,490 --> 00:09:34,250
Was it not an accident?

192
00:09:35,130 --> 00:09:37,930
His sworn brother was Xu Yin's uncle.

193
00:09:38,260 --> 00:09:40,090
After Xu Yin's mother found out about it,

194
00:09:40,090 --> 00:09:42,090
she wanted to make the truth public,

195
00:09:42,150 --> 00:09:43,280
but he silenced her.

196
00:09:43,690 --> 00:09:45,020
He not only killed them,

197
00:09:45,510 --> 00:09:47,170
but also took their property.

198
00:09:47,360 --> 00:09:50,160
He used that money to secure his position.

199
00:09:51,330 --> 00:09:52,770
Xu Yin was still young back then.

200
00:09:52,770 --> 00:09:55,890
He probably thought a child
wouldn't remember anything.

201
00:09:55,890 --> 00:09:58,730
In fact, she hasn't forgotten
for a single day.

202
00:09:59,090 --> 00:10:00,460
I see.

203
00:10:00,570 --> 00:10:01,570
In that case,

204
00:10:01,730 --> 00:10:03,730
Miss Xu Yin going abroad to lay low

205
00:10:04,010 --> 00:10:05,770
was indeed a wise move.

206
00:10:07,610 --> 00:10:10,070
Xu Qingdao asked Xu Yin to come back
this time

207
00:10:10,360 --> 00:10:11,490
for another reason.

208
00:10:14,760 --> 00:10:16,190
[Medical Report, Xu Qingdao]

209
00:10:14,920 --> 00:10:16,040
Xu Qingdao is sick.

210
00:10:16,610 --> 00:10:16,970
No,

211
00:10:16,990 --> 00:10:17,550
he...

212
00:10:18,290 --> 00:10:20,620
he wants his daughter to give him
a kidney?

213
00:10:21,250 --> 00:10:23,110
Even a cornered rabbit will bite,

214
00:10:23,200 --> 00:10:26,040
not to mention she's no pushover.
